  "title": "Prime Rib - It's Easier Than You Think",
  "description": "Prime rib is easier than you think with this recipe and a few fool-proof ingredients: a little steak seasoning, garlic, and a good, accurate thermometer.",
  "authors": [
    "KLEVEAR"
  ],
