  "ingredients": [
    "1 (5 pound) bone-in beef prime rib roast",
    "1 tablespoon olive oil",
    "2 teaspoons Montreal-style steak seasoning (such as McCormick®)",
    "1 teaspoon chopped garlic",
    "1 teaspoon Italian seasoning",
    "1 teaspoon mustard powder"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/F9NX40QfkkxMFXL--YmXjmQ1554=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-230368-prime-rib-its-easier-than-you-think-VAT-step-01-8b605dfbe2fe4bcfaf095cc69ed55e45.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/230368/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place roast, bone-side down, onto a rack set in a roasting pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/w6hBZ8olRxs7DniP5gN7RM64gyI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-230368-prime-rib-its-easier-than-you-think-VAT-step-02-99adbf1774484907b551ff505eefda26.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/230368/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk olive oil, steak seasoning, garlic, Italian seasoning, and mustard powder together in a small bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pYV-gX3-rhyiLjCwfhe_WnHpOhk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-230368-prime-rib-its-easier-than-you-think-VAT-step-03-7291958f5d01451c96e885cb967bec9a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/230368/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread over roast; set aside until roast comes to room temperature, about 45 minutes. Preheat the oven to 450 degrees F (230 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/B0k64YAAEw58FQbvauTJfQyl-_w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-230368-prime-rib-its-easier-than-you-think-VAT-step-04-ecc8466e77c748a6a0ddf1c327334a58.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/230368/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven for 20 minutes. Insert a meat thermometer into the thickest part of the roast, not touching the bone. Reduce the oven temperature to 325 degrees F (165 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mQ_hzWKSfleoBU_tQIH3CxUE-7I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-230368-prime-rib-its-easier-than-you-think-VAT-step-05-841415839097424ea6de7e8102daafe1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/230368/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Continue cooking until reaches desired degree of doneness, or an internal temperature of 145 degrees F (65 degrees C) for medium is reached, about 1 1/2 to 2 hours. Remove from the oven, cover with a doubled sheet of aluminum foil, and set aside to rest in a warm area before slicing, 10 to 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/J2bwnqCefYTk1k6I3-3ShyMd23s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-230368-prime-rib-its-easier-than-you-think-VAT-step-06-2250d59744914b248002887023ee6b96.jpg"
      ],
